    6. Arrange sprites in the objects zone so their bbox-centers' relative positions match the markers' relative positions (this is the output-first step: assign colors to sprites = marker colors, then replace with placeholder to get input).
    7. Verify pairwise Chebyshev gaps >= 3 between objects and >= 2 to legend.
    8. Output = recolor each sprite to its matched marker color. Input = all sprites in placeholder color.
